WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Start with a line to your future self:
“Dear future me, today felt special.”

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Show detail prompts. The workshop
flags “special” and asks what differed.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Use the starting draft for the revision.
Both fields now hold the same words.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Give the moment an object and an action.
The blue mug wobbles on the table.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Compare the drafts. The folded napkin
is the detail future you can picture.
